    <name>LOViT 100 Mile course</name>
    <desc>Track points (with elevations) copy the organizer's official 100-mile GPX download ("LOViT 100M 2025"), linked from runlovit.com/gpx on 2026-08-13 as the current course file for the February 2027 race. The line GPS-measures 97.6 miles against the aid chart's 100-mile cumulative frame, which governs pass miles. Station waypoints are placed at each station's first chart mile along this track (the download carries no waypoints).</desc>
    <link href="https://www.runlovit.com/gpx"><text>LOViT GPX course files page</text></link>
